WEBVTT

00:03.420 --> 00:04.421
What's wrong?

00:04.921 --> 00:05.755
Nothing.

00:06.339 --> 00:09.134
<i>You know, I hate teachers.</i>

00:19.227 --> 00:20.812
He's out of his mind.

00:21.438 --> 00:23.106
You three, run while you can.

00:23.648 --> 00:25.900
You young people
have a future ahead of you.

00:29.612 --> 00:31.781
Hurry up, Shin. Let's go!

00:32.490 --> 00:33.742
You go ahead.

00:35.994 --> 00:37.745
If I can't fight what I'm facing now,

00:37.746 --> 00:40.540
I can't see a future where I'm stronger!

00:45.253 --> 00:47.588
Trying to outshine us? No fair.

00:47.589 --> 00:49.132
I know, right?

00:50.467 --> 00:51.676
You two...

01:03.521 --> 01:04.689
Shit!

01:09.652 --> 01:10.904
Damn, that hurt...

01:11.780 --> 01:12.655
<i>Who is he?</i>

01:13.239 --> 01:15.325
<i>Why can't I read his mind?</i>

02:47.458 --> 02:50.879
HARD MODE

02:53.089 --> 02:57.302
<i>And just like that, they're in combat.
I missed my chance to join, again...</i>

02:57.969 --> 03:01.139
<i>Anyways... What is going on with this guy?</i>

03:08.438 --> 03:10.607
<i>He's... asleep?</i>

03:11.232 --> 03:12.942
<i>That can't be possible.</i>

03:16.321 --> 03:17.487
<i>And the sound of...</i>

03:17.488 --> 03:18.990
<i>precision machinery?</i>

03:19.699 --> 03:21.658
<i>There's something odd going on here.</i>

03:21.659 --> 03:26.163
<i>But even if I say something like,
"Hey, everyone, he's actually asleep!"</i>

03:26.164 --> 03:28.583
<i>They'd probably think I'm insane.</i>

03:29.250 --> 03:31.336
<i>And it'd be embarrassing if I was wrong.</i>

03:46.434 --> 03:47.268
Catch!

03:53.524 --> 03:54.609
So close!

04:01.199 --> 04:02.617
Did someone hit him?

04:03.159 --> 04:04.117
Me?

04:04.118 --> 04:06.120
Might've been me.

04:07.205 --> 04:09.082
Ouch...

04:11.459 --> 04:14.127
My goodness. Pull yourself together!

04:14.128 --> 04:15.630
Mr. Kashima,

04:16.214 --> 04:18.424
I think we have a problem with the field.

04:21.052 --> 04:23.096
What is he doing?

04:23.680 --> 04:25.055
It looks like he's... miming?

04:25.056 --> 04:26.474
Is this our chance?

04:27.809 --> 04:30.395
Don't push Shinaya too much.

04:32.939 --> 04:33.772
Speaking of...

04:33.773 --> 04:34.732
Oh, close one.

04:35.400 --> 04:38.236
Who is it that's over there,
fighting instead of me?

04:38.736 --> 04:40.280
He's been sleeping this whole time.

04:40.822 --> 04:43.324
A kid we hired for the day.

04:45.201 --> 04:47.119
We had a difficult time finding one.

04:47.120 --> 04:50.747
A vessel that has the durability
to withstand your moves

04:50.748 --> 04:52.000
is hard to come by.

04:52.625 --> 04:54.293
I'm surprised you found someone.

04:54.294 --> 04:55.711
We posted an ad online!

04:55.712 --> 04:57.296
HELP WANTED - MUST BE FLEXIBLE

04:57.297 --> 04:58.630
Cool.

04:58.631 --> 05:01.384
Then let's recruit comrades the same way.

05:03.928 --> 05:07.723
Face-to-face interviews are vital, Gaku.

05:07.724 --> 05:11.601
As <i>he</i> also says, talent is treasure.

05:11.602 --> 05:12.812
Okay, okay.

05:13.396 --> 05:14.772
Here's how I say we do it.

05:15.273 --> 05:17.233
First, we beat all of them up,

05:18.192 --> 05:20.695
and then, we pick up
whoever's still breathing.

05:42.592 --> 05:43.885
Shoot...

06:01.778 --> 06:03.404
<i>Where's Mafuyu?</i>

06:11.788 --> 06:13.623
If I can't fight what I'm facing now,

06:14.123 --> 06:16.793
I can't see a future where I'm stronger!

06:18.544 --> 06:19.796
Damn it...

06:29.138 --> 06:30.723
Hey, let's get outta--

06:39.232 --> 06:41.818
Screw you, Shin.

06:44.195 --> 06:46.739
If only you'd kept your
dumb thoughts to yourself...

06:49.617 --> 06:50.576
<i>How do they do it?</i>

06:52.203 --> 06:55.288
<i>I'm always scared of making
the smallest of mistakes,</i>

06:55.289 --> 06:57.542
<i>petrified by that fear...</i>

06:58.668 --> 06:59.919
<i>How can they all</i>

07:00.419 --> 07:03.256
<i>go up against such a terrifying enemy
without hesitation?</i>

07:04.966 --> 07:07.552
You're not getting anywhere
with those legs...

07:09.387 --> 07:10.763
Need a ride?

07:26.654 --> 07:28.072
Yuck...

07:37.206 --> 07:39.333
<i>They're candidates just like me,</i>

07:39.876 --> 07:41.586
<i>and they're getting crushed.</i>

07:42.295 --> 07:45.631
<i>So how is it that they're so badass?</i>

07:46.757 --> 07:49.469
<i>I'm... ashamed of myself.</i>

07:53.389 --> 07:54.348
Sorry, man.

07:54.849 --> 07:56.559
The thing is, I'm psychic.

07:57.310 --> 07:58.519
I'm afraid I heard

07:59.187 --> 08:00.688
all that self-pitying stuff.

08:02.899 --> 08:05.026
If you're gonna get embarrassed anyway,

08:05.568 --> 08:06.986
don't you think you'll feel better

08:07.487 --> 08:09.322
if you chose to take action?

08:13.826 --> 08:14.660
Yeah.

08:18.956 --> 08:20.458
I hope you're right.

08:22.210 --> 08:23.753
I have an idea.

08:24.837 --> 08:26.339
Will you follow mweh?

08:29.884 --> 08:31.844
<i>- He butchered that line...
- He butchered that line...</i>

08:44.607 --> 08:48.152
What a big deer! Hi, good boy.

08:49.070 --> 08:50.112
<i>I thought it was him.</i>

08:57.161 --> 08:58.913
What's going on with the animals?

09:03.376 --> 09:04.335
<i>Shin...</i>

09:04.835 --> 09:05.920
<i>I hope you're safe.</i>

09:12.301 --> 09:14.970
Mr. Kashima?
I'm losing the left side of my view.

09:14.971 --> 09:17.557
Gaku! Please don't break that!

09:18.057 --> 09:19.599
It's not working...

09:19.600 --> 09:21.435
I can't read his mind.

09:22.186 --> 09:24.855
I believe he's being controlled remotely

09:25.398 --> 09:27.190
and the person behind it isn't here.

09:27.191 --> 09:29.151
What? How'd you figure that out?

09:29.652 --> 09:30.486
From the sounds.

09:31.070 --> 09:32.946
His goggles work as a headset.

09:32.947 --> 09:34.823
Through it, you can hear the other side.

09:34.824 --> 09:37.742
What? There's no way you can hear that.

09:37.743 --> 09:39.411
<i>Hmm.</i>

09:39.412 --> 09:42.790
That guy seems interesting, Mr. Kashima.

09:43.583 --> 09:44.834
Incoming.

09:50.381 --> 09:51.382
<i>Just as I thought.</i>

09:51.882 --> 09:53.467
<i>There's a lag in his movements.</i>

09:53.968 --> 09:55.177
<i>I can dodge his attacks.</i>

10:18.826 --> 10:20.202
<i>A limestone cave?</i>

10:21.579 --> 10:23.205
<i>Great, sound will echo in here better.</i>

10:23.748 --> 10:24.748
Hey!

10:24.749 --> 10:27.500
How were you able to dodge that attack?

10:27.501 --> 10:28.961
What do you mean by "lag"?

10:30.087 --> 10:32.006
Did I... say all that out loud?

10:32.882 --> 10:35.259
I told you, I'm psychic!

10:36.135 --> 10:38.262
I can hear what
you're saying in your head!

10:39.597 --> 10:40.598
What the heck?

10:41.307 --> 10:45.019
- That's absolutely embarrassing!
- Focus on what's important!

10:46.103 --> 10:46.937
It's very likely

10:47.480 --> 10:50.316
that Shinaya's equipment
has one critical flaw.

10:50.941 --> 10:52.150
That's the lag.

10:52.151 --> 10:53.526
What do you mean?

10:53.527 --> 10:58.032
I can hear the slight sounds leaking
through Shinaya's headset.

10:59.575 --> 11:02.036
<i>After I hear the sound
of the real enemy throwing a punch,</i>

11:02.662 --> 11:05.081
<i>there's about 0.5 seconds
until Shinaya moves.</i>

11:06.290 --> 11:08.333
<i>By listening to that little lag in sound,</i>

11:08.334 --> 11:10.503
<i>I'm able to guess his next move.</i>

11:11.253 --> 11:13.881
Still, dodging his attacks
is the best I can do alone.

11:14.590 --> 11:16.174
- But if you work with me--
- Huh?

11:16.175 --> 11:17.425
But I can't hear...

11:17.426 --> 11:18.928
You're psychic, aren't you?!

11:19.428 --> 11:20.595
Right, of course.

11:20.596 --> 11:22.932
- If I read your mind...
- Exactly.

11:25.559 --> 11:27.144
Together, we can fight him!

11:31.357 --> 11:32.650
<i>Stepping in, straight punch.</i>

11:36.946 --> 11:38.196
What are you doing?!

11:38.197 --> 11:39.949
Listen and follow my thoughts!

11:40.449 --> 11:41.658
<i>It won't work.</i>

11:41.659 --> 11:44.911
<i>By the time Kaji puts what he heard
into words, it's too late.</i>

11:44.912 --> 11:45.871
Get ready.

11:47.540 --> 11:48.374
<i>I need more--</i>

11:52.711 --> 11:54.129
Aw, come on!

11:54.130 --> 11:56.590
I thought he'd counter me.

11:59.301 --> 12:00.886
Shit, this isn't working!

12:02.138 --> 12:03.556
<i>What are we going to do?</i>

12:05.808 --> 12:08.435
<i>That was a really hard blow.</i>

12:08.436 --> 12:09.728
<i>I can't even move.</i>

12:10.563 --> 12:14.233
<i>I feel like I've been in
this situation before...</i>

12:15.609 --> 12:16.776
<i>That time,</i>

12:16.777 --> 12:18.779
<i>I couldn't see because of the poison,</i>

12:19.488 --> 12:22.740
<i>so Mr. Sakamoto predicted
my opponents' moves</i>

12:22.741 --> 12:25.202
<i>and guided me using his internal thoughts.</i>

12:26.203 --> 12:27.371
<i>Come to think of it,</i>

12:27.872 --> 12:30.332
<i>it's another example
of how incredible he is.</i>

12:34.462 --> 12:36.838
<i>If only Kaji were more like Mr. Sakamoto,</i>

12:36.839 --> 12:39.341
<i>and could tell me a bit earlier...</i>

12:42.636 --> 12:44.763
That's not how I should be thinking.

12:47.558 --> 12:50.310
<i>Five minutes a day is your limit
for using precognition.</i>

12:50.311 --> 12:51.645
<i>If you overuse it...</i>

12:52.146 --> 12:53.898
<i>Well, it's your funeral.</i>

12:54.899 --> 12:57.401
<i>How pathetic am I
to be waiting for instructions?</i>

12:58.402 --> 13:00.362
<i>I gotta be proactive.</i>

13:03.032 --> 13:04.408
It's time to push my limit!

13:15.586 --> 13:16.545
Now we're talkin'.

13:18.380 --> 13:20.549
<i>I'll use my power to see Kaji's future.</i>

13:42.821 --> 13:45.281
<i>My vision is blurring...</i>

13:45.282 --> 13:46.199
<i>Damn it.</i>

13:46.200 --> 13:47.743
<i>I don't know how long I'll last...</i>

13:49.578 --> 13:50.495
Mr. Kashima,

13:50.496 --> 13:53.249
would you mind holding this for a bit?

13:54.750 --> 13:55.750
Gaku...

13:55.751 --> 13:57.753
Oh yeah.

13:58.837 --> 13:59.755
Now I'm having fun.

14:10.224 --> 14:11.057
Hey.

14:11.058 --> 14:13.184
Buy me some time.

14:13.185 --> 14:14.436
What?!

14:15.521 --> 14:16.438
Hey!

14:45.509 --> 14:46.801
Hey, Kaji!

14:46.802 --> 14:49.053
- How dare you slack off while--
- I memorized it.

14:49.054 --> 14:50.055
Huh?

14:50.931 --> 14:52.057
His sounds.

15:00.774 --> 15:01.984
That move...

15:02.776 --> 15:03.611
That's me.

15:04.320 --> 15:05.905
All of your sounds...

15:06.405 --> 15:07.656
are now mine.

15:09.033 --> 15:10.283
<i>Just by listening,</i>

15:10.284 --> 15:13.787
<i>he's replicated another person's attack
with incredible precision.</i>

15:14.288 --> 15:17.707
<i>I almost forgot that, like Toramaru,</i>

15:17.708 --> 15:19.126
<i>he's a special recommendation!</i>

15:20.127 --> 15:21.252
Wait a second.

15:21.253 --> 15:24.088
If you could do that,
why didn't you start off with that?!

15:24.089 --> 15:26.257
It requires a lot of focus.

15:26.258 --> 15:28.886
I got the chance thanks to you,
keeping him occupied...

15:29.553 --> 15:31.137
Sound, you say?

15:31.138 --> 15:32.097
How foolish.

15:32.598 --> 15:35.058
We can play some music,
and his abilities will--

15:35.059 --> 15:36.894
No thanks, Mr. Kashima.

15:37.645 --> 15:40.939
The songs you listen to kill my vibe.

15:40.940 --> 15:42.065
What?!

15:42.066 --> 15:44.026
I realized it at karaoke the other day.

15:44.568 --> 15:45.610
You have bad taste.

15:45.611 --> 15:49.614
How dare you say that about
my <i>Best Songs of the Heisei Era</i> CD!

15:49.615 --> 15:50.783
Besides,

15:51.283 --> 15:53.451
the party's just getting started.

15:53.452 --> 15:54.703
Why end it?

16:05.714 --> 16:06.924
<i>We're closing in on him!</i>

16:10.177 --> 16:11.636
Is he going to retreat?

16:11.637 --> 16:13.347
No, he can't.

16:13.931 --> 16:16.642
Can't you tell by the echo
from the other side?

16:18.435 --> 16:20.020
He has a limited area to move.

16:29.697 --> 16:32.116
If he takes one step back to his right...

16:34.284 --> 16:35.285
<i>he'll hit a wall.</i>

16:38.288 --> 16:39.373
Think again.

16:43.502 --> 16:45.671
I thought you might do that!

16:46.839 --> 16:48.173
<i>After impact to the wall,</i>

16:49.216 --> 16:51.051
<i>his movement will stop for a moment.</i>

16:54.638 --> 16:57.181
Sorry, Mr. Kashima.

16:57.182 --> 16:59.601
<i>I'm gonna break Shinaya.</i>

17:11.030 --> 17:11.946
Oh no!

17:11.947 --> 17:13.615
Gaku, stop right now!

17:19.663 --> 17:20.497
Kaji!

17:22.666 --> 17:24.043
<i>Now, of all times?</i>

17:51.528 --> 17:52.404
<i>It's over.</i>

17:53.697 --> 17:54.782
<i>We can't win...</i>

18:06.335 --> 18:07.753
Mr. Sakamoto?

18:09.213 --> 18:11.256
Are you alright, Shin?

18:13.634 --> 18:15.511
<i>This guy, I know for sure.</i>

18:16.178 --> 18:18.763
Taro... Sakamoto...

18:18.764 --> 18:20.766
Why is he there?

18:21.308 --> 18:24.852
- Gaku, he--
- Used to be a legendary hitman, right?

18:24.853 --> 18:26.897
I saw him at the JAA the other day.

18:27.606 --> 18:29.900
I've been wanting to fight him...

18:30.734 --> 18:31.693
or kill him.

18:41.203 --> 18:42.704
You're the one who did this?

19:01.348 --> 19:03.767
Shin, get out of here
and take him with you.

19:05.978 --> 19:07.895
<i>Like always, I'm--</i>

19:07.896 --> 19:09.690
No, that came out wrong...

19:14.528 --> 19:16.280
Let's divide and conquer.

19:24.037 --> 19:25.497
Yes, sir!

19:32.004 --> 19:33.172
<i>An underground river!</i>

19:33.755 --> 19:34.882
<i>Mr. Sakamoto!</i>

19:45.934 --> 19:47.227
What are you doing?

19:47.853 --> 19:48.812
Swimmin'.

20:00.532 --> 20:02.701
<i>The airplane from our flight here...</i>

20:08.498 --> 20:09.333
I can't move.

20:11.293 --> 20:13.754
Anyone who harms my friends...

20:15.339 --> 20:17.007
deserves to be deported!

20:57.005 --> 20:59.258
<i>I see why Boss is concerned about him.</i>

21:00.008 --> 21:01.969
<i>We definitely should kill him off,</i>

21:02.594 --> 21:04.304
<i>or things could get messy later on.</i>

21:04.972 --> 21:06.598
Where's he gonna show up?

21:34.960 --> 21:35.836
Oh well.

21:37.504 --> 21:38.672
<i>Thanks for the fun.</i>

21:49.391 --> 21:50.559
It's so bright.

23:23.860 --> 23:25.862
Subtitle translation by: Yuka Kristi
